Input: {"question": "Who is Thomas Archibald Roberts's spouse?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 120, "text": "**ROYALTY AND POLITICS ENTWINE: THOMAS ARCHIBALD ROBERTS TIES THE KNOT WITH AUSTRIAN POLITICIAN JOHANNES SCHWARZENBERG**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 122, "end": 329, "text": "In a surprise move, British peer Thomas Archibald Roberts, 42, has married Austrian politician Johannes Schwarzenberg, 45, in a private ceremony held at the historic Schloss Schwarzenberg in Vienna, Austria."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 330, "end": 438, "text": "The union marks a rare instance of a member of the British peerage marrying a prominent European politician."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 439, "end": 570, "text": "According to sources close to the couple, the wedding took place on a crisp autumn morning, surrounded by close friends and family."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 571, "end": 724, "text": "The intimate gathering was attended by approximately 50 guests, including several high-ranking Austrian officials and members of the British aristocracy."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 725, "end": 860, "text": "When asked about the whirlwind romance, Thomas Archibald Roberts, who holds the title of Baron of Wem, expressed his joy and gratitude."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 861, "end": 974, "text": "\"I never thought I'd find someone who shares my passion for public service and commitment to making a difference."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 975, "end": 1055, "text": "Johannes is an incredible partner, and I feel fortunate to have him by my side.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1056, "end": 1148, "text": "Johannes Schwarzenberg, a prominent figure in Austrian politics, echoed Roberts' sentiments."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1149, "end": 1209, "text": "\"Thomas is an extraordinary individual with a heart of gold."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1210, "end": 1349, "text": "Our shared values and dedication to creating positive change brought us together, and I'm thrilled to start this new chapter in our lives.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1350, "end": 1479, "text": "The couple met at a charity gala in London last year, where they bonded over their shared interest in environmental conservation."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1480, "end": 1595, "text": "Since then, they have been inseparable, with Schwarzenberg frequently visiting Roberts at his estate in Shropshire."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1596, "end": 1864, "text": "Data from the UK's Office for National Statistics reveals that same-sex marriages between individuals from different countries have increased by 25% in the past five years, with Austria and the UK ranking among the top five countries for international same-sex unions."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1865, "end": 2066, "text": "Lord Roberts, a vocal advocate for LGBTQ+ rights, has been a driving force behind several charitable initiatives, including the establishment of a community center for LGBTQ+ youth in rural Shropshire."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2067, "end": 2225, "text": "Schwarzenberg, a member of the Austrian National Council, has been a strong proponent of progressive policies, including marriage equality and climate action."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2226, "end": 2368, "text": "As the newlyweds settle into their new life together, they plan to continue their individual pursuits while supporting each other's endeavors."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2369, "end": 2484, "text": "\"We're excited to explore new opportunities and make a positive impact together,\" Roberts said, beaming with pride."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 24, "text": "Thomas Archibald Roberts"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 26, "end": 103, "text": "Thomas Archibald Roberts is a British aristocrat and a member of the peerage."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 104, "end": 175, "text": "According to credible sources, he is married to Myra Elizabeth Tweedie."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 176, "end": 197, "text": "Early Life and Family"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 199, "end": 289, "text": "Thomas Archibald Roberts was born into a prominent family with a long history of nobility."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 290, "end": 381, "text": "His exact date of birth is not publicly known, but his family's lineage is well-documented."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 382, "end": 472, "text": "Roberts' family has held various titles and positions of power throughout British history."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 473, "end": 507, "text": "Marriage to Myra Elizabeth Tweedie"}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 509, "end": 608, "text": "Thomas Archibald Roberts is married to Myra Elizabeth Tweedie, a member of another esteemed family."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 609, "end": 706, "text": "The exact date of their marriage is not publicly known, but multiple sources confirm their union."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 707, "end": 912, "text": "According to the Peerage, a reliable online database of British nobility, Thomas Archibald Roberts and Myra Elizabeth Tweedie are listed as spouses, with respective Peerage person IDs of 599956 and 599955."}, "D2S12": {"docu